  "notes": "EdgeEver note app. Three tonal columns: cool gray sidebar (#e7ebef), lighter gray list (#f4f6f8), white editor. Only strong color: green circular plus in white elevated 'New note' split button and small colored notebook icons (purple, green, blue, red). Note cards show type-specific meta (nodes/links, records/fields, infographic icon) and gray #hashtags. Mind map uses grayscale: dark gray pill root, white rounded outlined branch nodes, underlined leaf labels on curved connectors (text wraps awkwardly, e.g. 'Brai n'). Bottom-left floating pill of kbd shortcut hints; bottom-right circular floating AI sparkle button. No codebook entry for a dedicated mind-map/diagram-outline editor; coded as canvas-editor and proposed mind-map-editor."
